          "display": "text",
          "visualization_settings": {
            "text": "## How the rating is calculated\nRecent punctuality **45%** · older punctuality **15%** · average delay **15%** · current payment health **25%**. Missing components redistribute weight. No recent history → Unclassified. Default-altered history → Data review, no published rating. Severe arrears (>7 days) cap an otherwise available score at 60.\nContribution uses interest from the last 30 completed Bangkok days divided by the active cohort’s equal share; the high-value boundary is **1×**, independent of reliability **80**.\n**Schedule rule:** categories additionally reflect modified schedules. It recalculates automatically and is not a confirmed-hardship label. No manual review or overrides."
          }
        }
      }
